  "known_limitations": [
    "No new art was authored. The adapter reuses the existing swing, projectile and number visuals; the death cue is a code-driven sink-and-fade because death had no visual at all before D4. Real .tres profiles, crit differentiation and the quality budget are D5.",
    "Only three unit ids are migrated. Every other unit is still drawn by the legacy snapshot-diff path, by design (C4 vertical slice).",
    "C4 acceptance 3 (desktop/Android digest parity) and 5 (real APK) remain blocked by the Android pause, so C4 is partially, not fully, closed.",
    "Godot prints '1 resources still in use at exit' on baseline runs; present before D4 as well and not investigated in this stage."
  ]
